OL,3,A'High risk' of lake breaching and
OL,4,Acausing second flood, warns China
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs of Friday morning, an estimated 2.5
OL,7,Fmillion cubic metres of water had
OL,8,Faccumulated at the barrier lake,
OL,9,Faccording to state broadcaster CCTV. A
OL,10,Fbarrier lake is a body of water formed
OL,11,Fwhen debris dams up a river.
OL,13,FOfficials said that three million cubic
OL,14,Fmetres of water is expected to flow
OL,15,Finto the lake between Thursday and the
OL,16,Fweekend, posing a "high risk of
OL,17,Fbreach".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
